  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "To use Daemonic Pact, each of your army’s models needs at least one of these keywords: HERETIC ASTARTES, CHAOS KNIGHTS. The rule lets you recruit LEGIONES DAEMONICA allies even with a different Army Faction. Pool their points against one allowance: Incursion 250, Strike Force 500 or Onslaught 750. None of the allied models may be WARLORD or take Enhancements. Check KHORNE, TZEENTCH, NURGLE and SLAANESH separately. For a given god, each daemon unit outside BATTLELINE needs a separate BATTLELINE counterpart bearing that god’s keyword.",
